From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:22:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ieframe: window.external works (IShellUIHelper2 dispatch),
 AddFavorite and friends (3019)

The ShellUIHelper object that the browser hands to the document as
window.external had no type information: GetTypeInfo, GetIDsOfNames and Invoke
were stubs, so script could not call any of its methods. They now go through
the IShellUIHelper2 type information.

AddFavorite creates an Internet shortcut (.url file) in the user's Favorites
folder, named after the title (or the address). IsSubscribed, SqmEnabled and
PhishingEnabled return false and IsSearchProviderInstalled returns 0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

diff --git a/dlls/ieframe/ieframe.h b/dlls/ieframe/ieframe.h
index ab3cf92..8abc398 100644
--- a/dlls/ieframe/ieframe.h
+++ b/dlls/ieframe/ieframe.h
@@ -323,7 +323,8 @@ void unregister_iewindow_class(void);
 #define TID_LIST \
     XCLSID(WebBrowser) \
     XCLSID(WebBrowser_V1) \
-    XIID(IWebBrowser2)
+    XIID(IWebBrowser2) \
+    XIID(IShellUIHelper2)
 
